Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Ruins of Ahn Qiraj \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 60 20man Ruins of Ahn Qiraj]
[NX 60 20man Zul Gurub]

The Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj are a 20-player raid in the far south of Silithus. The way in is at the south-western edge of the Scarab Wall, south of Cenarion Hold. One quest: the head of Ossirian the Unscarred, the last boss, starts it.

-- Left out: the Scepter of the Shifting Sands chain (8286, 8288, 8730, 8578 and on), left out by every guide including Ahn'Qiraj (a 30-quest world chain with a reputation grind and the one-time gate event). Cenarion Circle repeatables and the class set turn-ins at Cenarion Hold: reputation grinds, not part of a dungeon run.
-- Left out: 8789 Imperial Qiraji Armaments and 8790 Imperial Qiraji Regalia (Arygos and Merithra of the Dream, inside the 40-player Temple of Ahn'Qiraj): their givers and turn-ins stand in AQ40, so they are left out here and belong in the Ahn'Qiraj guide (60_40man_Ahn_Qiraj); the AQ20 drops only feed them.

-- Horde: Orgrimmar to Un'Goro.
[A Horde] Start in Orgrimmar. At Doras, get the Orgrimmar flight path [P Orgrimmar] [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Out of the gate, down the Durotar road and over the Southfury bridge [G45.5,12.0 Durotar][G45.5,25.7 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar][G61.8,20.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Halikor (elite, level 12) may be by the road.
[A Horde] West to the Crossroads [G61.8,20.0 The Barrens][G51.0,20.0 The Barrens][G52.0,30.0 The Barrens] [OC]
[A Horde] South from the Crossroads on the road to the Great Lift [G52.0,30.0 The Barrens][G52.0,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G46.3,57.5 The Barrens][G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Camp Taurajo is beside the road. Azzere the Skyblade (elite 25), Hagg Taurenbane (elite 26) and the Razorfen elites (33-34) by the Great Lift may attack.

-- Alliance: Ironforge to Un'Goro.
[A Alliance] Start in Ironforge. At Gryth Thurden, get the Ironforge flight path [P Ironforge] [G55.9,47.9 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Out of Ironforge and down to the Dun Morogh road, then east to the North Gate Pass [G53.6,33.9 Dun Morogh][G51.6,39.8 Dun Morogh][G56.9,47.1 Dun Morogh][G62.6,54.7 Dun Morogh][G67.0,52.5 Dun Morogh][G76.0,48.5 Dun Morogh][G81.5,41.0 Dun Morogh][G84.1,33.8 Dun Morogh] [OC] \\ Hammerspine (elite 12) and Ghostfang (elite 10) roam near the road.
[A Alliance] Through the pass and north to Dun Algaz [G20.7,17.5 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan] [OC]
[A Alliance] North into the Wetlands and west along the road to Menethil Harbor [G55.1,73.7 Wetlands][G57.0,49.5 Wetlands][G49.5,40.0 Wetlands][G35.0,40.5 Wetlands][G26.3,40.5 Wetlands][G23.4,42.5 Wetlands][G22.4,44.0 Wetlands][G14.0,47.0 Wetlands][G12.3,52.2 Wetlands] [OC] \\ Elite Dragonmaw orcs (29-30), Modr, the Goaz Warder and a Nightveiled Rotheap (31-32), Highland Lurkers, Horrors and Elder Crocolisks (27-29) live near the road.
[A Alliance] At Shellei Brondir, get the Menethil Harbor flight path [P Menethil Harbor] [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Walk to the south pier [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands] [OC]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Theramore [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Off the pier and get the Theramore flight path [P Theramore] [G67.5,51.2 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] North out of Theramore along the shore road into the Barrens [G66.8,48.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.5,44.6 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.0,41.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G63.0,38.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.9,32.5 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.3,27.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G57.2,20.8 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.7,17.4 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.0,16.5 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Alliance] West across the Barrens to the south road, then south to the top of the Great Lift [G52.0,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G47.5,58.0 The Barrens][G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Camp Taurajo (Horde) is beside the road. Azzere the Skyblade (elite 25), Hagg Taurenbane (elite 26) and the Razorfen elites (33-34) by the Great Lift may attack.

-- Both factions.
Ride the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles [G32.1,24.2 Thousand Needles] [OC]
Down the canyon to the Shimmering Flats [G39.6,33.5 Thousand Needles][G45.1,41.7 Thousand Needles][G48.9,54.0 Thousand Needles][G55.0,56.0 Thousand Needles][G67.0,60.0 Thousand Needles][G70.0,72.0 Thousand Needles][G66.4,90.8 Thousand Needles] [OC] \\ Elites on the way: Ailgrha Splittusk (38) and a Ravaging Tempest (40) in the canyon, Stormheart (30) and Vile Sting (35) on the flats, a Silithid Ravager (37) at the south end.
South over the dunes into Tanaris [G41.2,6.0 Tanaris][G44.3,11.1 Tanaris][G44.5,13.7 Tanaris][G45.3,16.3 Tanaris][G49.0,17.0 Tanaris][G51.8,18.8 Tanaris][G51.7,21.5 Tanaris][G51.6,25.5 Tanaris] [OC]
[A Horde] At Bulkrek Ragefist, get the Gadgetzan flight path [P Gadgetzan] [G51.6,25.5 Tanaris]
[A Alliance] At Bera Stonehammer, get the Gadgetzan flight path [P Gadgetzan] [G51.0,29.3 Tanaris] \\ A Gadgetzan Enforcer (level 57) stands nearby.
North-west out of Tanaris toward the Un'Goro rim [G41.1,27.6 Tanaris][G37.6,22.4 Tanaris][G35.0,17.2 Tanaris][G31.5,11.9 Tanaris][G28.0,7.5 Tanaris] [OC] \\ Sandfury trolls (elite, level 42-45) stand outside Zul'Farrak near 38-41,21-28: keep east of them.
Down into Un'Goro Crater and west along the northern rim [G67.8,4.0 Un'Goro Crater][G64.6,4.1 Un'Goro Crater][G61.3,6.7 Un'Goro Crater][G58.5,8.9 Un'Goro Crater][G55.3,8.6 Un'Goro Crater] [OC] \\ Un'Goro raptors and devilsaurs (level 48-55) roam the crater floor; Pterrordaxes (50-52) fly along this rim.
At Gryfe in Marshal's Refuge, get the Marshal's Refuge flight path [P Marshal's Refuge] [G45.2,5.8 Un'Goro Crater]
North-west along the Un'Goro rim and through the northern pass into Silithus [G45.2,5.8 Un'Goro Crater][G38.7,10.2 Un'Goro Crater][G32.2,12.8 Un'Goro Crater][G25.7,11.5 Un'Goro Crater][G19.3,13.1 Un'Goro Crater][G12.8,17.7 Un'Goro Crater][G6.3,20.0 Un'Goro Crater][G3.0,20.3 Un'Goro Crater][G57.3,27.0 Silithus] [OC] \\ Short steep patches on the rim path; keep to the trail. Sand Skitterers and Dredge Strikers (level 55-56) around the pass near 56,28.
[A Horde] South-west to Cenarion Hold. At Runk Windtamer, get the Cenarion Hold flight path [P Cenarion Hold] [G57.3,27.0 Silithus][G48.8,36.7 Silithus] [OC]
[A Alliance] South-west to Cenarion Hold. At Cloud Skydancer, get the Cenarion Hold flight path [P Cenarion Hold] [G57.3,27.0 Silithus][G50.7,34.6 Silithus] [OC]

-- Down to the Scarab Wall.
[A Horde] From the Horde flight master south out of Cenarion Hold and across the open sand to the Scarab Wall [G48.8,36.7 Silithus][G48.8,72.9 Silithus] [OC] \\ Emissary Roman'khan (elite 63) stands at 48.8,58.1 on this line, Hive'Ashi Stingers and Swarmers (elite 57-58) roam near 50,41 and 49,51; Dredge Crushers, Stonelash scorpids and Rock Stalkers (56-59) along the way; Silithid Darters (60) by the Hold.
[A Alliance] From the Alliance flight master south out of Cenarion Hold and across the open sand to the Scarab Wall [G50.7,34.6 Silithus][G48.8,72.9 Silithus] [OC] \\ Emissary Roman'khan (elite 63) stands at 48.8,58.1 on this line, Hive'Ashi Stingers and Swarmers (elite 57-58) roam near 50,41 and 49,51; Dredge Crushers, Stonelash scorpids and Rock Stalkers (56-59) along the way; Silithid Darters (60) by the Hold.

-- Both factions.
South-west along the wall to the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj entrance [G48.8,72.9 Silithus][G36.5,93.9 Silithus] [OC] \\ A Hive'Regal Spitfire (elite 59-60) near 49.5,73.3, a Hive'Regal Ambusher (elite 59-60) near 48.5,76.2, Cyclone Warriors (57-59) near 47,59, and Grubthor (elite 58) near 44.4,80.8.
Into the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj. Kill Ossirian the Unscarred and loot the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred; right-click it to start [QA8791 The Fall of Ossirian] \\ Unverified on Forever: whether the head drops for every raid member or only one.
Leave the raid and walk back north to Cenarion Hold [G36.5,93.9 Silithus][G48.8,72.9 Silithus][G49.2,34.2 Silithus] [OC] \\ Same mobs as the way down: Grubthor, the Hive'Regal Spitfire, Emissary Roman'khan (elite 63) at 48.8,58.1 and the Hive'Ashi elites.
Commander Mar'alith takes [QT8791 The Fall of Ossirian] [G49.2,34.2 Silithus]
